@startuml context-diagram
!theme plain
title ParkEase BD: System Context Diagram (DFD Level 0)

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #FFF8E1
  BorderColor #E65100
  FontStyle bold
}
skinparam actor {
  BackgroundColor #E8F5E9
  BorderColor #2E7D32
}

left to right direction

actor "User" as User
actor "Provider" as Provider
actor "Manager" as Manager
actor "Security Guard" as Guard
actor "Administrator" as Admin

rectangle "0.0\nParkEase BD\nShared Parking Platform" as System

rectangle "SSLCOMMERZ\nPayment Gateway (Sandbox)" as SSL #E3F2FD
rectangle "OpenStreetMap\nTiles & Geocoding" as OSM #E3F2FD
rectangle "Cloudinary\n(property images)" as CDN #E3F2FD
rectangle "Email (SMTP)" as Mail #E3F2FD

User --> System : Vehicles, search filters,\nquote / hold / booking / payment,\ncheckout request, reviews, disputes,\nRefund Balance withdrawals
System --> User : Search results, quotes, booking\nstatus, QR access pass, payment,\nrefund and payout status, notifications

Provider --> System : Properties, images, parking resources,\nparking-right claims and evidence,\nlistings, availability, Guards, Manager\ndelegations, payout methods and requests
System --> Provider : Verification decisions, bookings,\nlive sessions, earnings, payouts,\nreviews, disputes, notifications

Manager --> System : Delegation acceptance, operations\nwithin granted permissions, Building\nManager votes and common rules
System --> Manager : Delegated properties, resources,\nlistings, bookings and Guards\n(earnings only with EARNINGS_VIEW)

Guard --> System : Property invitation response,\nQR credential, check-in / check-out
System --> Guard : Assigned properties and shifts,\nexpected arrivals, active sessions

Admin --> System : Property, Provider and parking-right\ndecisions, account actions, refunds,\npayout actions, dispute resolutions,\nfees, content and communications
System --> Admin : Review queues, analytics, ledger,\nreconciliation, audit and security events

System --> SSL : Hosted checkout session,\nvalidation and refund calls
SSL --> System : IPN / success callback

System --> OSM : Map tiles, address search
System --> CDN : Image upload / delete
System --> Mail : Verification codes,\nsetup links, campaigns

note bottom of System
  The backend is the single authority for
  availability, price, payment validation,
  refunds, earnings and authorization.
end note

@enduml
